  "extraction_notes": [
    "PDF SHA-256 verified as 5bba77d29680618bfc96f18bfea9b923b9b87155d915f44fd2947ca5838b0e1b.",
    "The supplied datasheet is a shared BC856 THRU BC858 family sheet. The device-code map on p. 1 identifies BC857C as code 3G, and the BC857C,BC858C rank row on p. 2 supplies the target hFE range.",
    "Polarity is PNP from the title and function diagram. Signed current and voltage values in the DC curves and scalar specifications are preserved as negative values.",
    "Figures 1 through 5 on p. 3 were manually digitized as compact approximate observations of the visible DC curves. The points are plotted readings, not interpolated or invented values. Figure 6 is an AC capacitance-versus-reverse-voltage graph and is intentionally omitted from curves for this DC-focused F2 extraction.",
    "The hFE table gives a guaranteed minimum of 420 and maximum of 800 at IC=-2 mA and VCE=-5.0 V for the C rank; no typical hFE was inferred from those bounds.",
    "VCE(sat) and VBE(sat) are guaranteed maximums at IC=-100 mA and IB=-5 mA; those maximum bounds were not converted into typical values.",
    "No scalar Cobo or Cibo value is tabulated. Because the extraction is limited to usable DC F2 evidence, the Fig. 6 capacitance curves are not included and cobo and cibo remain null.",
    "No Early-voltage scalar was extracted; Fig. 1 is a static output family curve at fixed base currents, not a published VAF value. No temperature-specific scalar table values were provided beyond the plotted Ta=25°C and Ta=100°C curves."
